&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;00e625c0: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;01101011&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;11100110&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;01000000&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;11110101&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10000001&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10010001&lt;/span&gt;  k.@...
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;00e625c6: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10100010&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;11010100&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;00011100&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;11001100&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;11111101&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;00101001&lt;/span&gt;  .....&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
