&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;00e625d2: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;00001011&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10110110&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;00100000&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;01101010&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10011000&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10011100&lt;/span&gt;  .. j..
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;00e625d8: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;00011000&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;01110010&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10101110&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;00001001&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10111001&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;11111001&lt;/span&gt;  .r....
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;00e625de: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10100101&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10010001&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;00010110&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;00110010&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;11111000&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10111010&lt;/span&gt;  ...2..
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;00e625e4: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;00111100&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;11001101&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;11011000&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10100111&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;00011010&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10111100&lt;/span&gt;  &amp;lt;.....
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;00e625ea: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10110111&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;11101110&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;00100100&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10100101&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;11111100&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;11110011&lt;/span&gt;  ..$...
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;00e625f0: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10110010&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;01110010&lt;/span&gt;                                      .r
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;환경변수 파일은 이러한 바이너리 파일을 글로벌하게 수행할 수 있도록 돕는 역할을 한다.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
